# The pictures of threads.md: a rod of 10 mm, threaded M10 from its
# top rim down; the thread's screen, the series list; then the thread
# edited to other forms.
cursor on
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 325 300
down L 325 300
up L 325 300
key esc
key x shift
# The extrusion is 10 mm deep, the circle's width, short of the 12 mm
# thread: hold its depth and make it 20.
twmove 505 133
twdown L 505 133
twup L 505 133
twmove 490 133
twdown L 490 133
twup L 490 133
edit 20
view default
move 325 300
down L 325 300
up L 325 300
mark 268 268 64 64
shot threads-1-rim gw
menu Features|Screw Thread...
size tw 900 600
cursor off
shot threads-2-screen tw
# The length, then flip: the top rim's normal points out of the rod.
twmove 220 150
twdown L 220 150
twup L 220 150
edit 12
twmove 64 230
twdown L 64 230
twup L 64 230
cursor on
twmove 70 260
mark 10 250 180 22 tw
shot threads-3-filled tw
twdown L 70 260
twup L 70 260
size tw 600 600
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
# The pointer where nothing is under it, so nothing is drawn hovered.
move 590 300
cursor off
shot threads-4-made
# From the side, the axis upright, to compare the forms.
view default
move 300 300
down M 300 300
move 300 200 M
up M 300 200
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
move 590 120
cursor off
shot threads-5-metric gw
# [edit thread], then another designation, made again.
cursor on
twmove 255 105
mark 146 102 124 22 tw
shot threads-6-edit-link tw
twdown L 255 105
twup L 255 105
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit Tr10x2
twmove 70 260
twdown L 70 260
twup L 70 260
cursor off
shot threads-7-trapezoidal gw
twmove 190 105
twdown L 190 105
twup L 190 105
twmove 217 110
twdown L 217 110
twup L 217 110
edit S10x2
twmove 70 260
twdown L 70 260
twup L 70 260
shot threads-8-buttress gw
# The series list, from [choose] beside the designation.
twmove 190 105
twdown L 190 105
twup L 190 105
size tw 900 600
twmove 289 110
twdown L 289 110
twup L 289 110
# The metric series, its sizes and M10's pitches.
twmove 154 135
twdown L 154 135
twup L 154 135
twmove 430 185
twdown L 430 185
twup L 430 185
shot threads-9-choose tw
# Back to the thread, now M10, made cosmetic.
twmove 55 285
twdown L 55 285
twup L 55 285
twmove 694 205
twdown L 694 205
twup L 694 205
twmove 70 260
twdown L 70 260
twup L 70 260
size tw 600 600
shot threads-10-cosmetic gw
